    "notes": [
      "Sundar Pichai opens Google I/O by demonstrating how generative AI is reimagining core Google products, introducing features like \"Help me write\" in Gmail (01:55), \"Immersive View for routes\" in Maps (03:42), and \"Magic Editor\" in Photos (06:04).",
      "He unveils PaLM 2 (09:26), a versatile new language model available in four sizes that powers over 25 products and specialized domains like medical reasoning with Med-PaLM 2 (11:41).",
